# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Node 工具链（pdf -> txt 转换用）
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# 转换出的书籍正文：体积大且涉版权，不提交
assets/text/

# 原始 PDF / 图片：同样涉版权且体积大（28MB+），不提交
assets/pdf/

# 打包/分享用的压缩包（与目录内容重复，体积大）：不提交
/code.zip
/使用说明.zip

# 回收目录（确认无用后自行 rm -rf .trash）
.trash/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Docker 练习产物（本地编译的二进制与日志：不提交、也不该 COPY 进镜像）
webapp
*.log
